# API call for ordering leads based on added date ascending
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/lead?ordering=added_date
Authorization: Basic ridhu:password@123

# API call for ordering leads based on added date in descending order
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/lead?ordering=-added_date
Authorization: Basic ridhu:password@123

# API call for lead filter by status
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/lead?search=New
Authorization: Basic ridhu:password@123

# API call for lead filter by status
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/lead?source=Website&status=New
Authorization: Basic ridhu:password@123

